      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "91-99 Mission Board",
      "text" : "Wait a minute!\n-You need to have an-\n-^4d4dff'Eden Group Mark'^000000-\n-to receive these missions.-"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "91-99 Mission Board",
      "text" : "Just walk away."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "91-99 Mission Board",
      "text" : "^0000FFEden Group^000000 missions?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "91-99 Mission Board",
      "text" : "How can I be a member of the ^0000FFEden Group^000000?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "91-99 Mission Board",
      "text" : "::The Eden Group Missions\n::are basically missions\n::requested by\n::people from all around the kingdom.\n::We just categorize them."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "91-99 Mission Board",
      "text" : "::In the Eden Group,\n::we sorted out the missions\n::according to the level of difficulty.\n::According to this level,\n::you can find\n::missions that\n::suit you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "91-99 Mission Board",
      "text" : "::When you are done,\n::you can come back\n::to the mission board."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "91-99 Mission Board",
      "text" : "::Then you will be\n::rewarded!!\n::Simple, isn't it!!\n::No commission required!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "91-99 Mission Board",
      "text" : "::You can become a member\n::of the Eden Group\n::to ^0000FFLaime Evenor^000000,\n::who is waiting on the 1st floor."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "91-99 Mission Board",
      "text" : "::If you become a member,\n::you will get an\n::\"^006400Eden Group Mark^000000\".\n::Then you will be able\n::to see the mission board."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
